The Victorian Web.

103
00:07:33,659 --> 00:07:37,192
1897 first edition scans.

104
00:07:37,905 --> 00:07:39,755
LibriVox audiobook.

105
00:07:40,188 --> 00:07:41,174
Dracula.

106
00:07:42,363 --> 00:07:48,248
And if you'd like to hear the full story, the two-hour sleep version of "Mina Keeps Watch" is on the channel.

107
00:07:48,461 --> 00:07:51,906
Thanks for studying with Unwritten Chapters.

108
00:07:52,345 --> 00:07:52,344
See you in the next one!

